<mxCell id="ota" value="&lt;b&gt;ota.c&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;sha256 = Fleet&#x27;s · signed by the&lt;br&gt;running image&#x27;s key · tinycrypt,&lt;br&gt;not a downgrade · limits, back-off,&lt;br&gt;cool-down · probation: self-test&lt;br&gt;+ IoT Core in 120 s, or rollback" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="330" y="440" width="240" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
